      "text": "Image from Communicating bad news - Issue 26"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "Feels like you got a raw deal, doesn’t it? Having to take the heat for a project you didn’t initiate — how unfair. Well, that’s part of the gig. No one ever said being a PM was easy. Many of the projects your team works on aren’t going to work out. So it’s important to get good at sharing bad news.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/13",
      "text": "Feels like you got a raw deal, doesn’t it? Having to take the heat for a project you didn’t initiate — how unfair. Well, that’s part of the gig. No one ever said being a PM was easy. Many of the projects your team works on aren’t going to work out. So it’s important to get good at sharing bad news."
    },
